<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>05 / 教师端</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>出卷与改卷：双向流程与阶段报告</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 18 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={1140} height={240} viewBox='0 0 1140 240'><rect x='0' y='20' width='520' height='190' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA'/><text x='260' y='52' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>正向：生成试卷</text><text x='260' y='92' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>选模板、知识范围与命题要求</text><text x='260' y='124' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>调用选题、生成、逐题解答和整卷检查</text><text x='260' y='156' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>形成可复核的试卷，教师核对题目与评分标准</text><text x='260' y='190' font-size='15' fill='#1E7BE0' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>产出：学生用卷 + 参考答案与解析 + 模板符合情况</text><rect x='620' y='20' width='520' height='190' rx='8' fill='#EAF3FD'/><text x='880' y='52' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>反向：评价已有试卷</text><text x='880' y='92' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>导入已有试卷</text><text x='880' y='124' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>评价知识点与套路覆盖、步骤难度及整卷分布</text><text x='880' y='156' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>不在教师端另设与试卷文档冲突的口径</text><text x='880' y='190' font-size='15' fill='#1E7BE0' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>阶段报告：未稳定的知识点与套路 / 覆盖范围 / 阶段变化 / 后续验证目标</text><path d='M520 115 L610 115' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2' stroke-dasharray='5 5'/><path d='M610 115 l-10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#00A9B5'/></svg></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #E8A33D', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>红线：不将“已经重新讲过”直接等同于学生已经掌握；两种报告（作业报告 / 阶段考试报告）共享证据，避免将同一次作答重复计入生涯评价</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：教师端设计思路.md §6–§7</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 55 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>